From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:46:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rt(controls,tse): bind the RT flashlight in the default TSE
 controls

Adds the "Flashlight" button (ctl_bFlashlight toggle) from
Serious-Engine-RT's Controls/00-Default.ctl to TSE's default controls.
TSE uses F for Down/Duck, so the default key is L instead of RT's F.
Only affects controls loaded from the default set; the variable does
nothing outside ray tracing.

Ported code: Serious-Engine-RT (https://github.com/sultim-t/Serious-Engine-RT,
GPL-2.0-only) by Sultim Tsyrendashiev; original copyright notices kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 SamTSE/Controls/00-Default.ctl | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/SamTSE/Controls/00-Default.ctl b/SamTSE/Controls/00-Default.ctl
index 7f0cecea003c28170bfd5fe656ca41dcd4ee9cca..5757cd4890e010024ef3d803d1590660d7c4f5af 100755
--- a/SamTSE/Controls/00-Default.ctl
+++ b/SamTSE/Controls/00-Default.ctl
@@ -112,2 +112,9 @@ Button
 
+Button
+ Name: TTRS Flashlight
+ Key1: L
+ Key2: None
+ Pressed:  ctl_bFlashlight = !ctl_bFlashlight;
+ Released: ;
+
 Button
